{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411100","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1441110001:1":{"text":"警備隊に入って間もない頃、ある事情で、銀月の祭壇に行ったんだ……","source_cn":"那是在我当上卫队成员不久后，因为某些事情，在银月祭庭外徘徊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36954A61D57D3150","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441110002:1":{"text":"悩みや辛いことは司祭に打ち明けるといいと聞いて訪ねたんだが、司祭たちは皆忙しそうで、私には目もくれなかった。","source_cn":"我听说有困惑痛苦之事可以向祭司倾诉，但祭庭的祭司们行色...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70283D18C9B64D9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441110003:1":{"text":"どうすればいいか分からず、長椅子に座っていると、ひとりの司祭が声をかけてきた。","source_cn":"我在一张长椅上坐了很久，直到另一个人向我搭话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA051B6C7A7C0B7B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441110004:1":{"text":"「何か打ち明けたいことがあるのか？」と、やや緊張した声で聞かれたよ。","source_cn":"他有些紧张地问我，是不是有什么话想对别人说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81D06BFFFF092F9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1441110004":{"text":"「何か打ち明けたいことがあるのか？」と、やや緊張した声で聞かれたよ。","source_cn":"他有些紧张地问我，是不是有什么话想对别人说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81D06BFFFF092F9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","do